      "refersTo": "plan-featured",
      "description": "Coluna de plano acesa pela luz índigo; os outros planos ficam sem fundo entre linhas finas.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-wrap\"><article class=\"ds-plan\"><div class=\"ds-plan-top\"><h3 class=\"ds-plan-name\">Loja</h3><span class=\"ds-tag\">Mais completa</span></div><p class=\"ds-plan-for\">O cliente escolhe, paga e você só embala.</p><p class=\"ds-plan-price\"><span class=\"ds-from\">a partir de</span>R$ 6.400</p></article></div>",
      "css": ".ds-wrap{background:#01010d;color:#eeedfb;font-family:Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;padding:24px}.ds-plan{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px;padding:36px;max-width:380px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 62% 72% at 52% 30%, #8d60ff 0%, #6331fb 36%, #3b17b4 66%, #13063b 100%);border-radius:0 0 24px 24px;color:#fff}.ds-plan-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.ds-plan-name{margin:0;font-family:Anton,Impact,sans-serif;font-weight:400;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:3rem;line-height:1}.ds-tag{background:#88f9c0;color:#01010d;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:0.6875rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.12em}.ds-plan-for{margin:0;font-family:'Bodoni Moda',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1.375rem;line-height:1.3}.ds-plan-price{margin:0;display:grid;gap:2px;font-family:Anton,Impact,sans-serif;font-size:4rem;line-height:1}.ds-from{font-family:Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.14em;color:#88f9c0}"
    },
