      "description": "Controle deslizante do Precifica: trilho reto, preenchimento mint, alça quadrada.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-wrap\"><label class=\"ds-field\"><span class=\"ds-field-head\"><span>Peso da peça</span><output>120 g</output></span><input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"40\" style=\"--p:40%\"></label></div>",
      "css": ".ds-wrap{background:#01010d;color:#eeedfb;font-family:Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;padding:24px}.ds-field{display:grid;gap:8px;max-width:420px;font-weight:700;font-size:0.9375rem}.ds-field-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#a9a8c8}.ds-field-head output{color:#eeedfb}.ds-field input{-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;width:100%;height:28px;margin:0;background:transparent;cursor:pointer}.ds-field input::-webkit-slider-runnable-track{height:8px;background:linear-gradient(#88f9c0,#88f9c0) 0/var(--p) 100% no-repeat,#12122c}.ds-field input::-moz-range-track{height:8px;background:#12122c}.ds-field input::-moz-range-progress{height:8px;background:#88f9c0}.ds-field input::-webkit-slider-thumb{-webkit-appearance:none;width:22px;height:22px;margin-top:-7px;background:#eeedfb;border:0;transition:transform 160ms cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)}.ds-field input::-moz-range-thumb{width:22px;height:22px;background:#eeedfb;border:0;border-radius:0}.ds-field input:active::-webkit-slider-thumb{transform:scale(1.15)}.ds-field input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #88f9c0;outline-offset:2px}"
